      <p class="photo-credit">Foto: <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bacurau-comum.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Jair Moreira / Wikimedia Commons</a> · CC BY-SA 4.0</p>
